ge": "english", "review": "game still wont initialise and no help, update or replies to emails from Rebellion. game worked fine till update.\n hasnt worked since. think i want my money back. Poor show from rebellion.\n    \nSubsequent to above review, Rebellion emailed a link with a fix which i applied and now the game works fine. Thanks Rebellion.", "timestamp_created": 1743335364, "timestamp_updated": 1747813420, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.484042584896087646", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191555386", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017904838", "personaname": "[Wack]^Mr.Buffel", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017904838/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 9383, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4886, "last_played": 1789288510, "avatar": "a81f74d138c3ca86e224db4b6c8f798fb921ec0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Excellent Game as was all the other Sniper Elite Games", "timestamp_created": 1743334247, "timestamp_updated": 1743334247, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5078125", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191537081", "author": {"steamid": "76561198289365305", "personaname": "Bendz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/itsBendz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 434, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 253, "last_played": 1751219657, "avatar": "a7bfa280272eeddf47f11abd5a48210e864352fe"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1743314961, "timestamp_updated": 1743314961, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "191534529", "author": {"steamid": "76561199130368122", "personaname": "✠GRAUER SEEHUND✠", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199130368122/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4652, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1393, "last_played": 1787548503, "avatar": "62366623b1eb92c5788c010b0a8fd2476ca5d45b"}, "language": "english", "review": "oh boy!! Where do I even begin with this trainwreck? Sniper Elite Resistance is less of a full priced game and more of a halfbaked DLC slapped with a $40 tag. Rebellion clearly put in the bare minimum effort, recycling the same tired mechanics while somehow making the experience worse than before.\r\nThe most infuriating part? The complete lack of a functioning anticheat. It’s laughable how Rebellion has ignored blatant cheating since Sniper Elite V2, and now here we are, years later, watching players sniping across the map with SMGs like it’s point blank range. How is this still a problem? It’s beyond obvious that Rebellion doesn’t care either they’re too lazy to fix it or they’re just hoping players won’t notice. Spoiler alert: We notice.\r\n\r\nThis game doesn’t even try to be a proper standalone experience. It feels like a rejected DLC for Sniper Elite 5 that they slapped a price tag on. The missions are embarrassingly short, the maps are empty and uninspired, and the whole thing reeks of minimum effort. Did Rebellion even playtest this? Or did they just copy paste assets and call it a day?\r\nThe  so called new content is just recycled garbage. Same mechanics, same AI (which still acts like braindead mannequins), and the same boring, repetitive objectives. There’s zero innovation, no fresh ideas just the same tired formula stretched thinner than Rebellion’s patience for fixing their broken games.\r\nIf you’re foolish enough to buy this, you’re rewarding Rebellion for their laziness, incompetence, and outright disrespect for their player base. So if you enjoy cheaters ruining matches, recycled content, and paying premium prices for scraps, then by all means, waste your money. Otherwise, steer clear Rebellion has once again proven they’d rather cut corners than deliver a polished, enjoyable experience. Shameful.", "timestamp_created": 1743311939, "timestamp_updated": 1743311939, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.534262180328369141", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 14, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 4, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "191496636", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025249764", "personaname": "numberfour", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025249764/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1787, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1143, "last_played": 1767533014, "avatar": "80b9eaafc8aa816019c1678e20430374a98c300a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good as always", "timestamp_created": 1743275322, "timestamp_updated": 1743275322, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"rec